@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

###
### ========================================
### Discord OAuth - Get Invite URL
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/discord/oauth/invite

###
### ========================================
### Discord OAuth - Get Current Discord User
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/discord/oauth/me

###
### ========================================
### Discord OAuth - Get User Guilds
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/discord/oauth/guilds

###
### ========================================
### Discord OAuth - Get Channels
### Uses the guildId stored in the user's Discord connection.
### ========================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/discord/oauth/guilds/channels